Easybrain is now looking for an experienced Game Designer with the ability to synergize various forms of content and systems design. You will be responsible for turning concepts into feature requirements and ensuring the highest quality of production, delivering fun in casual games that are played by millions of users daily. You will be part of a professional team that moves fast and where knowledge is free-flowing.

Responsibilities:

- Design and management of large features, systems, and content;

- Work with other departments to assist production, provide feedback, and meet delivery schedules;

- Effective use of feedback and data to modify products with an eye for retention and monetization.

Requirements:

- A minimum of 3 years’ experience in game design on a shipped product;

- Strong analytical skills;

- Ability to deliver creative results in a challenging environment;

- Excellent written and verbal communication skills;

- Passion for making and playing games;

- Russian language proficiency;

- English language proficiency.

Will be a plus:

- Great understanding of casual game market;

- Experience in complete implementations from concept to delivery;

- Experience in mentoring or managing others.

Benefits:

Besides the engaging tasks, support from experienced colleagues, challenge, and drive, we offer:

- Full support in relocating to countries where our offices are located;

- High-end market salary with performance bonuses;

- All needed equipment;

- Regular company events and monthly Friday meetings;

- Social benefits (private medical cover, sports reimbursement, etc.);

- Paid vacations, sick days;

- English, Greek, and Polish online language classes;

- Reimbursement for education and professional development.
